"height":4},{"title":"\"Cheap Lecture\" (2009)","description":"Performed at The Frankfurt LAB 21 September 2012","type":"vimeo","additional_fields":{"vimeo-id":"68313484","class":"show-info"},"id":"533671416d30347960320000","poster_image":{"url":"/system/uploads/jbmf/Cell/poster_image/full/vimeo-68313484-440624893-640.jpg","small":{"url":"/system/uploads/jbmf/Cell/poster_image/small/vimeo-68313484-440624893-640.jpg"},"medium":{"url":"/system/uploads/jbmf/Cell/poster_image/medium/vimeo-68313484-440624893-640.jpg"}},"x":21,"y":6,"width":4,"height":4},{"title":"\"The Cow Piece\" (2009)","description":"Performed at The Frankfurt LAB 21 September 2012","type":"vimeo","additional_fields":{"vimeo-id":"68313485","class":"show-info"},"id":"533671566d30347963380000","poster_image":{"url":"/system/uploads/jbmf/Cell/poster_image/full/screen-shot-2013-11-19-at-1.02.45-pm.png","small":{"url":"/system/uploads/jbmf/Cell/poster_image/small/screen-shot-2013-11-19-at-1.02.45-pm.png"},"medium":{"url":"/system/uploads/jbmf/Cell/poster_image/medium/screen-shot-2013-11-19-at-1.02.45-pm.png"}},"x":31,"y":1,"width":4,"height":4},{"title":"PROTO HTML cell","description":"Use this cell to put HTML content into a set","type":"html","additional_fields":{"html-content":"<h1>Cheap Lecture (2009)</h1><h2>\"Cheap Lecture is a translation of Lecture on Nothing, written by John Cage in 1949. Lecture on Nothing is a talk on composition which uses the same principles that Cage used for writing his music, particularly the kind of micro-macrocosmic structure which Cage used for many pieces and performances throughout his life.\"</h2><p>From the text about the piece on Jonathan Burrows' <a href=\"http://www.jonathanburrows.info/#/score/?id=2&t=content\" target=\"_blank\">website</a>, <a href=\"#/set/score-books/cheap-lecture\">View Score Book</a></p>"},"id":"5336718c6d30347966380000","poster_image":{"url":"/assets/fallback/default-cdee06016c3ca15e5810fcda0a4c5e44.png","small":{"url":"/assets/fallback/small_default-b553e49f4bf6795c93d62ecc6a576ac4.png"},"medium":{"url":"/assets/fallback/medium_default-cdee06016c3ca15e5810fcda0a4c5e44.png"}},"x":18,"y":6,"width":3,"height":4},{"title":"PROTO HTML cell","description":"Use this cell to put HTML content into a set","type":"html","additional_fields":{"html-content":"<h1>The Cow Piece (2009)</h1><h2>\"The performers stand at two tables and each follows their own score while always being aware of what the other person is doing. Many materials coincide precisely. The materials include: 6 plastic cows, speaking, singing, playing melodeon, mandolin, harmonimium, mouth organ, whistle and tin cane.\"</h2><p>From the text about the piece on Jonathan Burrows' <a href=\"http://www.jonathanburrows.info/#/score/?id=1&t=content\" target=\"_blank\">website</a>, <a href=\"#/set/score-books/the-cow-piece\">View Score Book</a></p>"},"id":"5336719c6d30347960330000","poster_image":{"url":"/assets/fallback/default-cdee06016c3ca15e5810fcda0a4c5e44.png","small":{"url":"/assets/fallback/small_default-b553e49f4bf6795c93d62ecc6a576ac4.png"},"medium":{"url":"/assets/fallback/medium_default-cdee06016c3ca15e5810fcda0a4c5e44.png"}},"x":31,"y":5,"width":4,"height":4}]}